# The vendored PipeWeave files are checksummed in
# kernelenergy/pipeweave/vendor/SHA256SUMS, and vendor.verify() fails the test suite
# if a byte changes. A clone onto a machine with core.autocrlf=true would rewrite them
# to CRLF on checkout and break that check for no real reason -- so pin them to LF.
kernelenergy/pipeweave/vendor/** -text
kernelenergy/pipeweave/vendor/SHA256SUMS -text

# The reference table and test fixtures are gzip; never touch them.
*.csv.gz binary
*.gz binary
